sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Router
    participant Dependency as Dependencies (DI)
    participant Service
    participant Repository
    participant DB as Database

    Client->>Router: HTTP request (Pydantic schema)
    Router->>Dependency: Depends(get_xxx_service)
    Dependency->>Service: build Service(repository)
    Router->>Service: call business method(schema)
    Service->>Repository: fetch/persist data
    Repository->>DB: SQL query (async session)
    DB-->>Repository: rows
    Repository-->>Service: domain/model objects
    Service-->>Router: response schema
    Router-->>Client: HTTP response (JSON)
